#	Page	Role and functionality	Connected pages
1	Login	Allows existing users to sign in using email and password.	Registration, Forgot Password, Dashboard
2	Registration	Allows new users to create a FinTrack account by entering their personal details.	Login
3	Forgot Password	Allows users to request a password-reset link through their email.	Login, Reset Password
4	Reset Password	Allows users to choose a new password through a valid reset link.	Login
5	Dashboard	The main financial overview showing total assets, liabilities, net worth, account balances, income, expenses, and investment performance.	Accounts, Transactions, Portfolio, Reports
6	My Accounts	Displays all financial accounts, including bank accounts, credit cards, and investment accounts. Allows users to add or manage simulated accounts.	Account Details, Transfers
7	Account Details	Displays information about one selected financial account, including its balance and transaction history.	My Accounts, Transactions, Transfers
8	Transactions	Displays the user's financial transaction history with filtering, sorting, and searching.	Account Details, Income & Expenses
9	Transfers	Provides a form for transferring simulated funds between the user's accounts.	My Accounts, Account Details, Transactions
10	Income & Expenses	Allows users to record and categorize income and expenses, review spending categories, and monitor cash flow.	Transactions, Dashboard, Reports
11	Investment Portfolio	Displays investment holdings, current values, asset allocation, profit/loss, and portfolio performance.	Trading, Dashboard, Reports
12	Trading	Provides stock search, price charts, watchlist information, and simulated buy/sell orders.	Investment Portfolio, Transactions
13	Financial Reports	Displays financial charts, spending trends, income versus expenses, net-worth history, and investment reports.	Dashboard, Transactions, Portfolio
14	User Profile	Allows users to view and update personal information, account preferences, and password settings.	Dashboard, Login after logout
15	Admin Dashboard	Provides authorized administrators with user management, system statistics, financial audit-log viewing, and application activity.	User Profile, Dashboard
